=head1 DESCRIPTION

Use this structure to tell Evidently whether higher or lower values are
desired for a metric that is used in an experiment.

=head1 ATTRIBUTES


=head2 DesiredChange => Str

C<INCREASE> means that a variation with a higher number for this metric
is performing better.

C<DECREASE> means that a variation with a lower number for this metric
is performing better.


